  "local_patches": [
    "Expose prepareJoin to persist signed requests before network transmission; preserve identity and request across retries.",
    "Add resolveInvitation(text, accessOverride) consumer API: explicit validated password replaces link password; empty/null overrides fail before HTTP.",
    "Retain consumer Gradle module and existing GroupTest/VaultGroupFlowTest; adapt upstream test vector paths to ../protocol; local tests use isolated service fixtures.",
    "group.changed forwarding is now identical to upstream v0.1.5 (previous consumer patch retained through upstream implementation).",
    "Protocol delegated to PasswordVault vault-core (relay_protocol, `relay-protocol-*` ops) via CoreProtocol.install: group signing/verification/chain advance, strict payload parsing, invitation links and envelopes. StrictPayload.java and CryptoTest/GroupTest/InvitationLinksTest were removed; core-dependent SDK tests are skipped unless a backend is installed; signing_key backfill is rejected. Transport, secretstream files and the journal stay local."
  ],
